### College Admission Portal API Tests
### Requires VS Code "REST Client" Extension

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@collegeId = 1
@applicationId = 1

### ==================== AUTH APIs ====================

### Register Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Doe",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Login Student
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ==================== ADMIN APIs ====================

### Create College Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/create-college-account
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "college1@test.com",
  "college_name": "Test Engineering College"
}

### Get Colleges (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/colleges?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Approve College
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/approve-college/{{collegeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/students
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ==================== COLLEGE APIs ====================

### Get College Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/college/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update College Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/college/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "A premier engineering college.",
  "location": "New York, USA",
  "courses": "Computer Science, Mechanical Engineering"
}

### Get College's Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/college/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Update Application Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/college/application-status/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "remarks": "Congratulations, you are approved!"
}

### ==================== STUDENT APIs ====================

### Get Approved Colleges
GET {{baseUrl}}/colleges

### Get College Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/colleges/{{collegeId}}

### Create Application
POST {{baseUrl}}/student/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "college_id": 1
}

### Get My Applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/student/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
